Package: incremental
Type: Package
Title: Vector Incremental Treatment Effects
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Denis", "Agniel", email = "denis.agniel@rand.org", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Max", "Rubinstein", email = "mrubinstein@rand.org", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: Implements vector incremental treatment effects for causal
    inference with multiple binary treatments. Provides cross-fitted one-step
    estimation based on the efficient influence function, with asymptotically
    valid Wald inference under a second-order product-rate condition on the
    nuisance estimators (this is not double robustness -- see the accompanying
    paper). Supports multiple divergence measures (KL, reverse KL, chi-squared,
    Hellinger) and comprehensive simulation tools.
